ssages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384970/extras/39d0c0360abc7a47b184f3aa9a4e6e53.poster.avif?t=1744765111\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384970/extras/39d0c0360abc7a47b184f3aa9a4e6e53.webm?t=1744765111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384970/extras/aff517ada6ef60c5c7b80909ef3afd88.avif?t=1744765111\" width=616 height=88 /></span>The puzzles and hidden objects are more than just challenges; they\u2019re pieces of Ava\u2019s journey. The game\u2019s visuals, inspired by color theory and abstract art, react to the music, creating a beautiful, dynamic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find hidden areas and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Piece together Ava's fragmented memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Watch the environment change with the music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384970/extras/30364ba704df6089ad1a535a406e8f4f.poster.avif?t=1744765111\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384970/extras/30364ba704df6089ad1a535a406e8f4f.webm?t=1744765111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Deev Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","